sequenceDiagram
    participant EC2 as EC2 (CloudWatch Agent)
    participant CW as CloudWatch API
    participant Alarm as CloudWatch Alarm
    participant SNS as SNS Topic
    participant User as On-Call Engineer
    
    loop Every 1 Minute
        EC2->>CW: PutMetricData (MemoryUtilization)
    end
    
    CW->>Alarm: Evaluate threshold (>80%)
    Alarm-->>Alarm: State change (OK -> ALARM)
    Alarm->>SNS: Trigger Action
    SNS->>User: Send SMS/Email Alert
